        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miriyamu gealas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gabalool Miriyamu sea Haruni badayda Musa aba badayda gatmooda eemeeda Gushi ghayi ghoah; aba gideaba nighi gatmooda eemeeda Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi saawa, “Huumwa gil NG'UTAMIIDA neada goobalool Musa ak ghwahidi? Neada ea meabaloaleasa eara aseasa?” Hean ghwayiiy NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda siisi was Musahiin ea siida garbabu muuchi gil ea ghang'al buuneesean mida badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasham, NG'UTAMIIDA Musa ea Haruni ea Miriyamu ak gwayeesha, “Arita jarooda agoogeeni asamwaguun, aweayeena jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa.” Hean gwarita jarooda fiisu asamwaguun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwararang'aan NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda daraneeda shamooghooda, ak ghamiinaada aba ghuuta maheemajeanda, ak gaguursa Haruni sea Miriyamu, ak gwardu jarooda duwaawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Asi ayiinya ng'asheegeasu; iimida sibaneeda jeedeang'wa, abeeda, aniineeda was NG'UTAMIIDA, gaydeahiimsa geaw niny aba jeeda giirgweatka, ak gaydeabalool niny aba jeeda giirgweatka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maygawuurji giduurji aba heeda siideanyu bea gadiyeeda, was Musa; niny ea garbabu aba jeedeaba gheenyu sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny gaydeabalool nea geeyamutooschi ghuut, aba gideaba gaydawoos daachi nea mii gwadeagooda; ak niny gayghwadaah ratooda NG'UTAMIIDA. Abeeda ghwasaan agooga inyas moawali arukunana ng'asheega munyas badayda siideanyu bea gadiyeeda, was Musa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayeat nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aba badahuuka nyaawa; ak ghang'eat gawa heechea gawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabeawa shamooghoodida uhuuda maheemajeanda; ak ging'ulayi, Miriyamu ghwanyas udamusuura, ak gaweeshiit ea ghawaar gapkeanda; hean gang'ula Haruni Miriyamu, ak ging'ulayi, ninyas udamusuura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Haruni Musa, “Ea ng'utamiideanyu, geamuscheey muuchi, adiyiini badahuukaasa riing'eeda, aba gideaba sisinyi ng'asheega leendeeda, ak geesinyi riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheey, adagawuurji siida ghayi meah, was dea niyaak banyeagaaschi meatkweanagi siyaak damanda rinna aba jeeda ghaamwat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyeawusa Musa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Ahaabwa, Ea ASEETA, geamuscheey ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Inyeeda gwachi goong'uusha ghwaan gheanyanga gwachi mayghabwaspwas ea ghwahita askwearjoojiga ispwa? Ghang'wana geerasa badayda museasooda askwearjooji ispwa, amang'ata geebiikta eeteelu gah gicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi Miriyamu geerasa riteayda museasooda eawooji ispwa; ak ea maneayi buuneeda ea eeteelu Miriyamu gah gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata hiji hean gabiisa gwaneayi buuneeda ghang'eada Haseroti, ak gwasin museasooda aba dareapcheeda Barani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
